      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I know that this has always been a vram issue, not necessarily a vrchat specific thing. But after the \"fix\" that was done to help mitigate it, I have experienced getting stuck at 11fps even through restarts of the game and SteamVR. When exiting the game everything would run perfectly fine, but immediately upon re-launching I would be stuck at 11fps again. Oddly, the issue persisted until I deleted my cache.",
      "viewerReactions": null
